Data types
.numerical - consists of numbers that can be measured, counted, or used in mathematical calculations 
.text/string data - consists of letters, words, sentences, or a mix od all
    .used as identifiers, not for calculation 
        e.g product name, customer address, notes, ID numbers
.date data - represents specific points in time, such as date or timestamp
    .crucial for tracking trends and events over time 
.categorical data - can be divided into groups or categories 
    .often represents labels, names, or discrete categories 
        e.g product color, rating, customer loyalty status

